# Secrets safety: refuse real BAAs, signed contracts, PHI-shaped data files
# in repo. Pinned to data file extensions so source paths that use "patient"
# as a product term (e.g. /services/patient-care-coordinator) still commit.
*.baa.pdf
*patient*.pdf
*patient*.csv
*patient*.xlsx
*patient*.json
*phi*.pdf
*phi*.csv
*phi*.xlsx
*phi*.json
